From 7ea27669974304f3301cfdfeb3b692b0e4cd6af1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Khaled <khaledchoucri@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 20:45:44 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] POC-5: BN attack kinds for every move, panels, Gen 3 statuses
 and weather, lane codes in the folder

- tools/attacks_curated.py -> src/pkbn/move_table.c: every Gen 3 move gets a grid kind modelled
  on a BN6 chip family (Sword/LongSword/WideSword/LifeSword, FireSwrd 3-panel line, Cannon,
  AirShot, Vulcan, Spreader, Tornado, Gun Del Sol cone, FireHit/GolemHit, Meteors, SandWorm dig,
  MiniBomb/BigBomb patterns, shockwave, wide wave, Air Hockey, slow ball, delayed shot, lock-on)
  plus its chip letters from tools/lanes_curated.py (one letter per copy).
- Panels from BN6 code: cracked, broken, poison (1 tick / 7 frames), holy (halves damage), grass.
- Gen 3 statuses, confusion, trapping, Leech Seed, weather and end-of-turn damage on a turn clock
  (one Custom gauge = one turn). Sleep breaks when hit (review rule).
- Review notes: Hyper Beam recharge locks the next Custom, Wish lands at the next Custom,
  Safeguard / Magic Coat block / bounce the next status move, Future Sight is a delayed shot,
  low-accuracy status moves are slow balls, Toxic / Poison Gas make poison panels.
- Folder: lane letters, BN same-code-or-same-chip rule, benched chips switch in Navi-style,
  wildcard Switch is a permanent 6th Custom slot. Moves cut by the review never become chips.
- Split into grid_battle.c / grid_moves.c / grid_field.c / grid_draw.c.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01FbWSqvcg6G5Gpw6ynvR5tJ
